- two caps searched: 1,885 ns, charged 56.5 units;
- one cap searched: 1,090 ns, charged 28.5;
- the bounds decide: about 229 ns, charged 0.5 units (about 22 ns).
That last kind is at most 24 × 23 = 552 tests a design, about 0.13 ms.

